1.33,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nrounded to two decimal places."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186528162 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "acc86fb6-2ef4-5f8f-b204-6e1fdbbf0530" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of a Triangle"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f4254b5e-b4d4-56bc-bd8b-79e02ed7bf7b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "921.5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528220}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f4254b5e-b4d4-56bc-bd8b-79e02ed7bf7b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "921.5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528220} :answer-field/id #uuid "ed27b396-d53a-5765-8d37-db0a89081e2e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528219}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "4cab157d-9e84-52bf-83e6-fcd9af854df4" :question/problem "![](images/b4/b4d346c76ff55f7e183aefa579c49b54022e75ea4b723c5d74954c5257dcdf2f.png)\n\nRounded to the **nearest tenth**, the area of $△ABC$ is{{field-1}} ${\\text{ft}}^{2}.$" :question/requires-calculator true :question/worked-solution "The formula for the area of the triangle is \n\n$$\nA=\\frac{1}{2}bc\\operatorname{sin}⁡A,\n$$\n\nwhere $∠A$ is between the sides of lengths $b$ and $c.$ \n\nHere, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}с & =AB=50, \\\\ b & =AC=45, \\\\ m∠A & ={55}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡{55}^{∘}=0.819\\,152,\n$$\n\nrounded to six decimal places,  we calculate the area as follows:\n \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 45\\cdot 50\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡{55}^{∘} \\\\  & =1125\\cdot (0.819\\,152…) \\\\  & ≈921.5\\,{\\text{ft}}^{2},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nrounded to the **nearest tenth**."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186528169 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "acc86fb6-2ef4-5f8f-b204-6e1fdbbf0530" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the A